==Battleground==
*2 [[HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat (Enemy)|HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cats]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*2 [[HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat (Enemy)|HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cats]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat (Enemy)|HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat]] spawns after 103.33 seconds<sup>3,100f</sup>.
*4 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use rush units such as [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to beat the stage as there is no boss and the [[HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat (Enemy)|HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cats]] appear on a timer.

